  "Al acabar los {n} días gratis, Google Play cobra {precio}. Cancela antes desde Google Play y no se cobra nada.": ["After the {n} free days, Google Play charges {precio}. Cancel before in Google Play and nothing is charged.", "No fim dos {n} dias grátis, o Google Play cobra {precio}. Cancele antes no Google Play e não se cobra nada.", "Après les {n} jours gratuits, Google Play prélève {precio}. Annulez avant dans Google Play et rien n’est prélevé.", "Dopo i {n} giorni gratis, Google Play addebita {precio}. Annulla prima da Google Play e non paghi nulla.", "Nach {n} Gratistagen berechnet Google Play {precio}. Vorher in Google Play kündigen, dann wird nichts berechnet.", "{n} 天免费期结束后，Google Play 扣款 {precio}。在此之前于 Google Play 取消则不扣款。"],
  "Google Play cobra {precio}. Cancela cuando quieras desde Google Play.": ["Google Play charges {precio}. Cancel any time in Google Play.", "O Google Play cobra {precio}. Cancele quando quiser no Google Play.", "Google Play prélève {precio}. Annulez quand vous voulez dans Google Play.", "Google Play addebita {precio}. Annulla quando vuoi da Google Play.", "Google Play berechnet {precio}. Jederzeit in Google Play kündbar.", "Google Play 扣款 {precio}，可随时在 Google Play 取消。"],
